WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:30.166
If sacrifice, austerity,

2
00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:33.375
and charity are done with faith and
the remembrance of

3
00:00:33.375 --> 00:00:36.625
‘Om Tat Sat,’

4
00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:40.625
then they become pure and spiritual.

5
00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:42.083
Now Lord Krishna

6
00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:44.708
raises an important question –

7
00:00:44.708 --> 00:00:48.375
what will happen if there is no faith at all?

8
00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:51.500
Is it enough to merely perform
rituals and good deeds,

9
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.791
or is some deeper foundation necessary

10
00:00:54.791 --> 00:00:57.875
to keep them steady?

11
00:00:57.875 --> 00:01:00.583
In this final verse of Chapter 17,

12
00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:02.583
He explains that faith itself

13
00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:04.750
is the foundation of spiritual practice.

14
00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.708
This faith should not be ordinary,

15
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:11.250
but at the very least scripturally
aligned, and at its best

16
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:16.083
connected to the feeling of
pleasing the Supreme.

17
00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:17.708
Without faith, even the

18
00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:20.958
greatest actions lose their value –

19
00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:22.875
they receive no lasting

20
00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:26.791
fruit in this world, nor in the next.

21
00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.291
Lord Krishna says

22
00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:35.625
that whatever is offered –

23
00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:39.250
whether it is an oblation in sacrifice, charity,

24
00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:42.583
or austerity – if it is done without faith,

25
00:01:42.583 --> 00:01:45.375
that is, ashraddhaya,

26
00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:47.333
then it is called asat –

27
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:49.291
that is, impermanent,

28
00:01:49.291 --> 00:01:53.750
hollow, and spiritually fruitless.

29
00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:57.541
Such an action neither gives fruit after death,

30
00:01:57.541 --> 00:01:59.291
nor holds any real

31
00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:01.666
importance in this life.

32
00:02:01.666 --> 00:02:03.125
Just as counterfeit

33
00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:04.125
currency may look

34
00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:07.083
like ordinary currency,

35
00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:10.083
but has no value at the bank,

36
00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:12.208
in the same way actions without faith

37
00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:14.458
may look excellent from the outside,

38
00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:17.541
but they have neither spiritual dignity

39
00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:20.750
nor inner transformation.

40
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.291
This is the same teaching

41
00:02:22.291 --> 00:02:25.166
that Lord Krishna gave earlier in Chapter 4,

42
00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:27.583
verse 40 –

43
00:02:27.583 --> 00:02:32.958
‘nayam loko'sti na paro na
sukham samshayatmanah.’

44
00:02:32.958 --> 00:02:36.083
That is, the person who is without faith

45
00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:40.541
finds happiness neither in this world,
nor in the next.

46
00:02:40.541 --> 00:02:44.375
Even the three gunas – sattvic, rajasic,

47
00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:47.791
and tamasic – if they are accompanied by faith,

48
00:02:47.791 --> 00:02:50.875
lift the seeker upward step by step.

49
00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:52.708
But if there is no faith,

50
00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:54.333
then the very foundation

51
00:02:54.333 --> 00:02:56.791
of spiritual growth is uprooted.

52
00:02:56.791 --> 00:03:00.125
It is necessary to understand that faith

53
00:03:00.125 --> 00:03:01.541
does not mean merely

54
00:03:01.541 --> 00:03:04.458
believing in rituals and customs.

55
00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:07.708
Faith means that inner conviction

56
00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:11.833
and trust – that the seeker's life, their effort,

57
00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:13.916
and their purpose are connected to some higher

58
00:03:13.916 --> 00:03:17.875
truth, and not to ego alone.

59
00:03:17.875 --> 00:03:19.750
In truth, even if an action

60
00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:23.583
is incomplete, but it is done with truth, respect,

61
00:03:23.583 --> 00:03:26.916
and spiritual aspiration,

62
00:03:26.916 --> 00:03:28.583
then it has value.

63
00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:31.500
But however complete a ritual

64
00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.500
may be, if it is without faith,

65
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:37.375
then it remains empty.

66
00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:40.541
Lord Krishna's purpose here is not

67
00:03:40.541 --> 00:03:45.583
to discourage those whose
faith is still developing,

68
00:03:45.583 --> 00:03:47.083
but rather that

69
00:03:47.083 --> 00:03:49.333
they should connect their actions

70
00:03:49.333 --> 00:03:53.708
to truth at some level – whether
in the knowledge of the scriptures,

71
00:03:53.708 --> 00:03:56.333
in the service of the Supreme, or at the very least

72
00:03:56.333 --> 00:03:58.166
in the feeling of devotion.

73
00:03:58.166 --> 00:03:59.833
The sacred syllables described

74
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:05.208
in the previous verses – Om Tat Sat –
are given for this very reason,

75
00:04:05.208 --> 00:04:08.458
so that those whose perspective is still mixed

76
00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:13.875
can slowly rise higher and their
faith can become pure.

77
00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:17.083
In practical life, this means –

78
00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:19.333
do not give charity merely for show

79
00:04:19.333 --> 00:04:22.291
or to wipe away guilt,

80
00:04:22.291 --> 00:04:26.083
but give it with compassion and a higher purpose.

81
00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:27.666
Do not perform fasting, prayer,

82
00:04:27.666 --> 00:04:31.791
or austerity only to complete a formality,

83
00:04:31.791 --> 00:04:35.583
but do it with the feeling of service and offering.

84
00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:38.583
Do not let spirituality become ostentation –

85
00:04:38.583 --> 00:04:42.083
make it meaningful and heart-touching.

86
00:04:42.083 --> 00:04:45.458
Faith begins with curiosity,

87
00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:49.541
then it deepens into trust, and ultimately

88
00:04:49.541 --> 00:04:53.166
is transformed into unwavering love.

89
00:04:53.166 --> 00:04:56.500
This verse reminds us that

90
00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:00.750
it is necessary to nourish faith at every step.

91
00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.708
Because without faith – even the

92
00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:07.541
greatest actions – do not give lasting fruit.

93
00:05:07.541 --> 00:05:10.833
With this very teaching, Chapter 17

94
00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:12.458
comes to a close –

95
00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:15.750
we are not to perform actions
merely for the sake of doing,

96
00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.875
but to do them with awareness,

97
00:05:18.875 --> 00:05:23.333
and most importantly – with the
feeling of devotion.

98
00:05:28.166 --> 00:05:31.708
Faith is not only a feeling –

99
00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:34.291
it is the power that gives

100
00:05:34.291 --> 00:05:37.375
life to your actions.

101
00:05:37.375 --> 00:05:42.166
You may give charity, do service,
or perform austerity.

102
00:05:42.166 --> 00:05:45.875
But if there is no faith in your heart –

103
00:05:45.875 --> 00:05:50.083
neither in Me, nor in dharma, nor in yourself –

104
00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:52.666
then your efforts remain bound

105
00:05:52.666 --> 00:05:54.458
to the material world,

106
00:05:54.458 --> 00:05:56.958
tied to impermanent results.

107
00:05:56.958 --> 00:05:58.166
Without faith,

108
00:05:58.166 --> 00:06:02.833
even the greatest actions become meaningless.

109
00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:04.583
But when

110
00:06:04.583 --> 00:06:06.083
you have faith in a higher

111
00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:10.291
purpose, then even the smallest

112
00:06:10.291 --> 00:06:14.666
act shines with meaning.

113
00:06:14.666 --> 00:06:18.875
Faith in Me gives you direction.

114
00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:22.541
Faith in dharma gives you steadiness.

115
00:06:22.541 --> 00:06:24.500
And faith in yourself

116
00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.708
gives you the courage to rise again

117
00:06:26.708 --> 00:06:28.875
after every fall.

118
00:06:28.875 --> 00:06:32.583
Your faith should arise not from blind belief,

119
00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:37.916
but from the wisdom of the scriptures.

120
00:06:37.916 --> 00:06:40.166
Nourish it with daily practice,

121
00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:44.708
reflection, and the experiences of life.

122
00:06:44.708 --> 00:06:48.291
When you act with faith,

123
00:06:48.291 --> 00:06:51.750
your experience keeps deepening.

124
00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.583
And as experience grows,

125
00:06:54.583 --> 00:06:57.625
faith becomes firmer still.

126
00:06:57.625 --> 00:06:59.333
This is the path

127
00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:03.291
by which you move beyond merely
fulfilling duty,

128
00:07:03.291 --> 00:07:07.541
and begin to live a life of joy.

129
00:07:07.541 --> 00:07:10.500
When you walk with faith,

130
00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:13.791
you do not only perform the right actions –

131
00:07:13.791 --> 00:07:17.750
you yourself become the right person.

132
00:07:22.583 --> 00:07:23.541
Every family,

133
00:07:23.541 --> 00:07:25.458
at some point in life,

134
00:07:25.458 --> 00:07:27.708
passes through a period of challenges –

135
00:07:27.708 --> 00:07:29.458
financial difficulties,

136
00:07:29.458 --> 00:07:32.916
health problems, or mutual misunderstandings.

137
00:07:32.916 --> 00:07:34.291
It is in these very

138
00:07:34.291 --> 00:07:37.458
moments that your faith is tested.

139
00:07:37.458 --> 00:07:42.333
And these are the very moments
when faith shines the most.

140
00:07:42.333 --> 00:07:46.375
When even in hard times you
choose what is right –

141
00:07:46.375 --> 00:07:48.291
and not what is easy –

142
00:07:48.291 --> 00:07:51.833
then you do not only show your strength,

143
00:07:51.833 --> 00:07:55.583
but plant deep in your children's hearts

144
00:07:55.583 --> 00:07:59.375
the roots of the values of an ideal.

145
00:07:59.375 --> 00:08:04.916
They may perhaps not remember
 everything you said, but

146
00:08:04.916 --> 00:08:09.500
they will surely remember your
patience, your trust in Me,

147
00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:16.083
and your unshakable resolve toward truth.

148
00:08:16.083 --> 00:08:20.583
This silent message shapes their character.

149
00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:24.166
So when circumstances feel heavy,

150
00:08:24.166 --> 00:08:27.875
do not ask – ‘Why us?’

151
00:08:27.875 --> 00:08:30.416
Instead ask –

152
00:08:30.416 --> 00:08:35.166
‘What support can we hold on to?’

153
00:08:35.166 --> 00:08:38.666
Hold on to your faith –

154
00:08:38.666 --> 00:08:41.458
in Me, in your values,

155
00:08:41.458 --> 00:08:46.458
and in your family's ability to rise.

156
00:08:46.458 --> 00:08:49.500
Because I am with you.

157
00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.458
And when you walk with faith,

158
00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:54.958
then your family

159
00:08:54.958 --> 00:08:59.375
does not merely endure difficulties –

160
00:08:59.375 --> 00:09:03.208
it emerges from them even stronger.

161
00:09:03.208 --> 00:09:09.125
This is the path by which a legacy
of virtues is born.

162
00:09:13.916 --> 00:09:19.375
Faith is not limited to temples or rituals –

163
00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:22.250
it is the very power that keeps you

164
00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.750
steady in the office

165
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.458
boardroom, amid deadlines,

166
00:09:26.458 --> 00:09:31.750
and in moments of decision.

167
00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.750
Trust in the vision of the organisation,

168
00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.541
trust in the ability of your team,

169
00:09:37.541 --> 00:09:41.625
trust in your own competence – and above all,

170
00:09:41.625 --> 00:09:44.666
trust in that unseen power

171
00:09:44.666 --> 00:09:47.750
which guides your path –

172
00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:50.583
this is what gives life its purpose.

173
00:09:50.583 --> 00:09:51.791
So many people

174
00:09:51.791 --> 00:09:55.166
work only to earn a salary.

175
00:09:55.166 --> 00:09:59.083
They remain indifferent toward their work.

176
00:09:59.083 --> 00:10:03.791
These people are always crying
over their sorrows.

177
00:10:03.791 --> 00:10:07.458
On the contrary, those who,

178
00:10:07.458 --> 00:10:10.666
even in an ordinary job, work with
their heart in it,

179
00:10:10.666 --> 00:10:14.083
are soon promoted.

180
00:10:14.083 --> 00:10:15.416
Without faith

181
00:10:15.416 --> 00:10:18.416
you may keep going, but from within

182
00:10:18.416 --> 00:10:24.833
you will feel lost, discouraged, and directionless.

183
00:10:24.833 --> 00:10:26.083
But I

184
00:10:26.083 --> 00:10:29.625
never want blind belief from you.

185
00:10:29.625 --> 00:10:31.750
I want from you –

186
00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:34.083
thoughtful faith.

187
00:10:34.083 --> 00:10:37.291
Such faith as is built from reflection,

188
00:10:37.291 --> 00:10:41.250
matured by experience, and which stands firm

189
00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:45.666
in some higher truth, above mere
profit or praise.

190
00:10:45.666 --> 00:10:47.291
You do not need

191
00:10:47.291 --> 00:10:51.583
to control every outcome.

192
00:10:51.583 --> 00:10:55.625
Do your part with sincerity –

193
00:10:55.625 --> 00:10:59.208
and leave the rest to Me.

194
00:10:59.208 --> 00:11:03.666
When faith and effort walk together,

195
00:11:03.666 --> 00:11:06.458
then success goes beyond mere numbers

196
00:11:06.458 --> 00:11:10.166
and gains depth.

197
00:11:10.166 --> 00:11:14.375
And in that very moment, not only do you rise –

198
00:11:14.375 --> 00:11:15.333
you also

199
00:11:15.333 --> 00:11:19.666
inspire others to rise.
